    <string name="documentation_quick_start">Quick start</string>
    <string name="documentation_quick_start_step_1">Enable HuaweiPods in LSPosed and select the Bluetooth, My Devices, and Quick Device Connect scopes (Huawei AI Life audio is optional).</string>
    <string name="documentation_quick_start_step_2">Use Restart scopes on the home page and wait for the Bluetooth service to become ready.</string>
    <string name="documentation_quick_start_step_3">Pair in system Bluetooth first, then select the connected device in HuaweiPods.</string>
    <string name="documentation_images">Earphone images</string>
    <string name="documentation_images_step_1">Supported newer models report their model and color through the earphone protocol; images are downloaded from the official Huawei CDN.</string>
    <string name="documentation_images_step_2">Legacy devices such as FreeBuds 3 cannot reliably report their color. Confirm the color once in Image settings.</string>
    <string name="documentation_images_step_3">The display priority is always: manual image, official image, built-in image.</string>
    <string name="documentation_troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="documentation_troubleshooting_step_1">No data on the detail page: make sure the earphones are connected, then restart Bluetooth and Settings scopes.</string>
    <string name="documentation_troubleshooting_step_2">Image not updated: reopen the detail or system Settings page; restart the Settings scope if needed.</string>
    <string name="documentation_troubleshooting_step_3">Attach LSPosed logs when reporting a problem, and note that logs may contain Bluetooth device identifiers.</string>
    <string name="documentation_offline_note">This is the offline core guide shipped with the APK. The website continues to provide the full support matrix and debugging notes.</string>
